					DATAFORM 「Even? Odds? %SPLIT_SINGLE(@"H-Huh? Which is it, really...?:Why can't I just choose both, ugh...:Hmm... Fifty-fifty is all that separates me from comfortable life, isn't it～?:Oh maaan, this is so tough...", nPersonality:(キャラ - 5))%」/「Mmmm, nnghh... Uuuhhh...」/「...%賭け:分類%!」
